!! GasChemicalMechanism.in - Carbon Bond 6 revision 5 (CB6r5), Williams case
!! ASP
!! Translated from the CMAQ v5.4+ mechanism definition CB6r5-AE7-AQ (mech_cb6r5_ae7_aq.def) by
!! CB6r5Translation/cmaq2asp.py - see CB6r5Translation/CB6r5_README.md for every choice and warning.
!! Gas-phase core only (the 225 R<n> reactions of the .def file, minus R216 ECH4+OH, which is the CH4 tracer
!! reaction; CH4 + OH is R<n> above).  Chlorine, DMS, mercury, toxics-diagnostic, SA, BL/BP, POA and
!! aerosol heterogeneous groups are NOT included (gas chemistry only, per project scope).
!! Rates are evaluated for ASP at the case conditions only where a rate form cannot be represented
!! (R46, R24) - T = 288.4 K, P = 880.0 mb for this case.
!! Rate-flag conventions are those of the original ASP deck (see the file header of the old decks).
!!
!! Format: "!! <label>: <CMAQ statement>" precedes each translated reaction.
!! WARNING lines name rate forms ASP cannot reproduce exactly.

!! R1: <R1> NO2 = NO + O # 1.0/<NO2_IUPAC10>;
NO2 => NO + O ; 0; 1;
!! R2: <R2> O + O2 + M = O3 + M # 6.00E-34^-2.6;
!!   APPROXIMATION: ASP hard-wires O + O2 + M (flag 9): 5.6e-34 N2 / 6.0e-34 O2 instead of CB6r5 6.0e-34 for M
O => O3 + M ; 9;
!! R3: <R3> O3 + NO = NO2 # 2.07E-12@1400;
O3 + NO => NO2 ; 2.07e-12; 0; -1400; 1;
!! R4: <R4> O + NO = NO2 # 1.00E-31^-1.6 & 5.00E-11^0.30 &0.85 &0.84;
